{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:834f107d8bf17fa9ae567145ac72e1ea65bb5f13d7bb9b81feefbf21a99763a7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f860bad1be58a2ed8dc8d302b7888b6bcb3692b9738b8863174b14a012ee5b7",
      "text": "制作人，辛苦了。刚才\n宣传影像的确认工作已经结束了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c82495a2b9d0d6c1082d58d8869b2b273f4e43a7298b226be07901e6a79ae8e8",
      "text": "虽然我们在拍摄中展示的，\n只是初学者也能做到的技巧，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3771bce80318fa74d9451e03ae76e5297260428a7c0ea0828309c3ffb3468da1",
      "text": "但在演出效果的精心设计下，看起来\n非常有魄力，让我很受触动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25fb9f7fa5cafa21b47dd509c625da7c77dcbd98207e1126e0d81de13222fae8",
      "text": "因为大家练习了\n很多次嘛",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f35d2394c4cc81d856ee5f031abf87df8758147cf9e72a4bb8f94e1fe1088933",
      "text": "九郎先生的花式动作\n非常漂亮哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9ed0e8ef9b39baaf5a58d97ae8c74bf2b4f6800085ae5df23a7f6f192ea7dbd",
      "text": "谢谢您。没有妥协、\n坚持练习总算是有意义的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9622161c9fce51086290b11a7b55f8092004125b1c843dc1c4c6ff0b260db76",
      "text": "太好了。多亏了大家\n陪我一起练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c46c982e73baad27e7ce573859484958865028a486edd88562967b34e9da683",
      "text": "虽然我也曾担心过能否顺利掌握技巧，\n但在享受乐趣的同时，练习也切实推进了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeb0e2b93fac156543125b0e1347fdeb95312bab3e7400aa667e016daae5cdbf",
      "text": "曾经穿不习惯的服装，也逐渐适应了……\n现在，连我自己都很喜欢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dd5af314cc0b44e4538ca6dbc5c97a0ec1d79a12abe777c83041edd325c0bf2",
      "text": "能通过工作体会到接触未知世界的乐趣，\n我感到非常高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:097d19609fe8859a030e5113d43e33a1744c50cb0d2506e7c58a924c7b1ab3d0",
      "text": "今后也一起挑战\n各种各样的工作吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f9a93ed629e459dcfe55430ed4fcb5c22274852f5c6615e3ced08778afb9a61",
      "text": "能听到●●●●プロデューサー这么说，\n让我心里非常踏实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_a:2_4_019_03_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8318632e4e994582a26620c4f15a8e29047c3a39ed85b78e32266f678ea82278",
      "text": "下一份工作我也会全力以赴的。\n那么，先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
